==Indonesian==
{{wikipedia||lang=id}}

===Etymology===
From {{bor|id|nl|abortus}}, from {{der|id|la|abortus}}, perfect active participle from {{m|la|aborior||pass away; miscarry}}, from {{m|la|ab||from, away from}} + {{m|la|orior||rise, get up; appear}}. {{doublet|id|aborsi}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|id|/ˈabɔrt̪ʊs/}}
* {{hyphenation|id|abor|tus}}

===Noun===
{{id-noun|head=|pl=abortus-abortus}}

# {{lb|id|obstetrics}} {{l|en|abortus}}; {{l|en|abortion}}: the expulsion from the womb of a foetus or embryo before it is fully developed, with loss of the foetus; either naturally as a spontaneous abortion (now usually called a {{l|en|miscarriage}}), or deliberately as an induced abortion (see {{cog|id|aborsi}}). 

